## Key Architectural Patterns

### LLM Provider Protocol
Adding a new provider = implement `LLMProvider` + register in `LLMRouter.allProviders`:

```swift
// LLMProvider.swift
protocol LLMProvider: Sendable {
    var id: String { get }
    var displayName: String { get }
    var defaultModel: String { get }
    var requiresAPIKey: Bool { get }
    func complete(systemPrompt: String, userText: String, model: String) async throws -> String
}
```

Register in `LLMRouter.allProviders` (order = default priority). API keys stored via `KeychainStore.saveAPIKey(for: id)`.

### Text Capture Flow
`TextCapture.captureSelectedText()` → AX API (`AXUIElementCopyAttributeValue`) first → if empty, `PasteboardSnapshot` + synthetic ⌘C roundtrip. Always restore pasteboard after.

### Prompt Variables (v1.2.0+)
`{clipboard}`, `{app_name}`, `{language}`, `{selected_text}` — resolved in `PromptVariableResolver` before LLM call.

### Threading
UI code is `@MainActor`. LLM calls are `async`/`await`. `AppDelegate` is `@MainActor final class`.

