## Build & Release

```bash
make open          # XcodeGen generate + open in Xcode
make build         # Release build (local ad-hoc signed)
make release       # Full: prepare-binary + sign + notarize + DMG + appcast update
```

**Before `make release`:**
- `release.env` may exist (gitignored): `DEVELOPER_ID`, `NOTARY_PROFILE`, optional `VERSION`
- If `VERSION` is not set, release scripts read `MARKETING_VERSION` from `project.yml`
- `xcrun notarytool store-credentials tippi-notary` must be set up
- Sparkle CLI at `~/Developer/sparkle-tools/bin/generate_appcast`

**Version bump:** update `project.yml` `MARKETING_VERSION`, `CHANGELOG.md`, README/version docs, and in-app Help if user-visible behavior changed. `release.env VERSION` is only an explicit override and must not drift from `project.yml`.

**Never edit `.xcodeproj` directly** — always edit `project.yml` and run `make generate`.

