## Useful Reset Commands

```bash
# Reset TCC permissions
tccutil reset Accessibility com.tippi.app
tccutil reset ListenEvent com.tippi.app

# Reset UserDefaults (custom prompts, settings — Keychain untouched)
defaults delete com.tippi.app

# Full uninstall
rm -rf /Applications/Tippi.app && defaults delete com.tippi.app 2>/dev/null
```

